1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,660
Matthew 2

2
00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:07,060
Now after Jesus was born in Bethlehem of Judea in the days of Herod the king,

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:10,980
behold, wise men from the east came to Jerusalem, saying,

4
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:15,540
Where is he who has been born king of the Jews?

5
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:20,680
For we saw his star when it rose, and have come to worship him.

6
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:25,500
When Herod the king heard this, he was troubled, and all Jerusalem with him,

7
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,560
and assembling all the chief priests and scribes of the people,

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
he inquired of them where the Christ was to be born.

9
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:34,300
They told him,

10
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:38,780
In Bethlehem of Judea, for so it is written by the prophet,

11
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:45,100
And you, O Bethlehem, in the land of Judah, are by no means least among the rulers of Judah,

12
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:49,540
for from you shall come a ruler who will shepherd my people Israel.

13
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:57,520
Then Herod summoned the wise men secretly, and ascertained from them what time the star had appeared.

14
00:00:58,360 --> 00:00:59,920
And he sent them to Bethlehem,

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:00,380
saying,

16
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:04,000
Go, and search diligently for the child.

17
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:10,200
And when you have found him, bring me word, that I too may come and worship him.

18
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:13,280
After listening to the king, they went on their way.

19
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:17,740
And behold, the star that they had seen when it rose went before them

20
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:20,840
until it came to rest over the place where the child was.

21
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:25,560
When they saw the star, they rejoiced exceedingly with great joy.

22
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:29,620
And going into the house, they saw the child with Mary his mother,

23
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,680
and they fell down and worshipped him.

24
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:37,580
Then opening their treasures, they offered him gifts, gold and frankincense and myrrh.

25
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:41,340
And being warned in a dream not to return to Herod,

26
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:44,200
they departed to their own country by another way.

27
00:01:45,060 --> 00:01:46,160
Now when they had departed,

28
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:50,360
behold, an angel of the Lord appeared to Joseph in a dream and said,

29
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:57,440
Rise, take the child and his mother, and flee to Egypt, and remain there until I tell you.

30
00:01:57,980 --> 00:01:59,980
For Herod is about to search for the child,

31
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:02,000
to destroy him.

32
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:05,760
And he rose, and took the child and his mother by night,

33
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:09,560
and departed to Egypt, and remained there until the death of Herod.

34
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:13,320
This was to fulfill what the Lord had spoken by the prophet.

35
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:16,320
Out of Egypt I called my son.

36
00:02:17,020 --> 00:02:20,620
Then Herod, when he saw that he had been tricked by the wise men,

37
00:02:20,620 --> 00:02:25,620
became furious, and he sent and killed all the male children in Bethlehem,

38
00:02:25,620 --> 00:02:28,940
and in all that region who were two years old or under,

39
00:02:28,940 --> 00:02:29,940
according to the time of the Lord, and in all that region who were two years old or under, according to the time of the Lord,

40
00:02:29,940 --> 00:02:32,940
and in all that region who were two years old or under, according to the time that he had ascertained from the wise men.

41
00:02:32,940 --> 00:02:35,940
Then was fulfilled what was spoken by the prophet Jeremiah.

42
00:02:36,940 --> 00:02:41,940
A voice was heard in Ramah, weeping and loud lamentation,

43
00:02:41,940 --> 00:02:43,940
Rachel weeping for her children.

44
00:02:43,940 --> 00:02:46,940
She refused to be comforted, because they are no more.

45
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:53,940
But when Herod died, behold, an angel of the Lord appeared in a dream to Joseph in Egypt, saying,

46
00:02:54,940 --> 00:02:58,940
Rise, take the child and his mother, and go to the land of Israel.

47
00:02:58,940 --> 00:02:59,940
Rise, take the child and his mother, and go to the land of Israel.

48
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:03,940
For those who sought the child's life are dead.

49
00:03:03,940 --> 00:03:07,940
And he rose and took the child and his mother, and went to the land of Israel.

50
00:03:07,940 --> 00:03:12,940
But when he heard that Archelaus was reigning over Judea in place of his father Herod,

51
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:14,940
he was afraid to go there.

52
00:03:14,940 --> 00:03:17,940
And being warned in a dream, he withdrew to the district of Galilee.

53
00:03:17,940 --> 00:03:20,940
And he went and lived in a city called Nazareth,

54
00:03:20,940 --> 00:03:24,940
that what was spoken by the prophets might be fulfilled.

55
00:03:24,940 --> 00:03:28,940
He shall be called a Nazarene.

